  "visible_text": "Kit & gear\nWho we are\nKōrin EK-S Burr Unit, SSP-HG 64\n\nFlat-burr grind engine with a 64 mm SSP-HG set and a dial for the bench.\n\nBuilt in small batches at our Lviv workshop. Each unit is checked by hand before it leaves the bench, and the glaze differs slightly from piece to piece.\n\nCare: rinse with warm water. Avoid abrupt temperature change.\n\nWhat is in the box\n\nThe set, a cloth pouch, and a card with our brewing notes.\n\nBurr\tSSP-HG 64\tRetention\tZero-index\tRPM band\tMotor\nFlat\tHG\t<0.3 g\tYes\t800–1400\tDC 180 W\n\nReserve this one\n\nHalden Hearth Roasting Co. · Lviv · hello@haldenhearth.example\nMore",
